    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In order to save your family, you must venture from home in order to find and return a dragon\u2019s egg.\u00a0Catsploration is a high fantasy adventure with narrative and 3D platforming elements. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1710260/extras/71003438062d0106a9ac613097c6da5e.poster.webp?t=1750724262\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1710260/extras/71003438062d0106a9ac613097c6da5e.webp?t=1750724262\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your search for Magneteia's lost egg will take you all across Driftstone. You must explore lost caves and navigate through dangerous hazards in order to gather what you need.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1710260/extras/fba068b0d33fd9b052bfc48272b21ffc.poster.webp?t=1750724262\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1710260/extras/fba068b0d33fd9b052bfc48272b21ffc.webp?t=1750724262\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Key Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> A fun physics based player controller</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A narrative-driven adventure through hand-crafted environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Magical items and an inventory to manage them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Difficult to find collectibles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A world consistent with Pathfinder 2e. We tell a short level 0 adventure, without combat</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Although Catsploration is a solo indie game, made by me, Paul, this game also includes content made by hundreds of individuals. Please take the time to see the in game credits menu to learn more.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">AI and Voice Acting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Non-player characters in Catsploration use AI-generated voices, while I voice the narrator.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In order to save your family, you must venture from home in order to find and return a dragon\u2019s egg.\u00a0Catsploration is a high fantasy adventure with narrative and 3D platforming elements. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1710260/extras/71003438062d0106a9ac613097c6da5e.poster.webp?t=1750724262\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1710260/extras/71003438062d0106a9ac613097c6da5e.webp?t=1750724262\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your search for Magneteia's lost egg will take you all across Driftstone. You must explore lost caves and navigate through dangerous hazards in order to gather what you need.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1710260/extras/fba068b0d33fd9b052bfc48272b21ffc.poster.webp?t=1750724262\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1710260/extras/fba068b0d33fd9b052bfc48272b21ffc.webp?t=1750724262\" class=\"bb_img\" /></picture></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Key Features</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> A fun physics based player controller</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A narrative-driven adventure through hand-crafted environments</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Magical items and an inventory to manage them</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Difficult to find collectibles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A world consistent with Pathfinder 2e. We tell a short level 0 adventure, without combat</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">About</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Although Catsploration is a solo indie game, made by me, Paul, this game also includes content made by hundreds of individuals. Please take the time to see the in game credits menu to learn more.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">AI and Voice Acting</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Non-player characters in Catsploration use AI-generated voices, while I voice the narrator.</p>",
